WEBVTT

00:00:00.249 --> 00:00:02.558
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We <b>stayed</b> at a hotel last summer.

00:00:04.556 --> 00:00:06.603
I <b>went</b> to Spain twice last year.

00:00:08.598 --> 00:00:10.345
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>didn’t stay</b> with friends.

00:00:12.319 --> 00:00:14.085
She <b>didn’t go</b> to France.

00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:17.837
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Did</b> you <b>stay</b> for the weekend?

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:21.118
<b>Did</b> you <b>go</b> to Madrid?

00:00:23.068 --> 00:00:24.613
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Yes, I <b>did</b>.

00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:28.137
No, we <b>didn’t</b>.

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:31.299
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Where <b>did</b> you <b>stay</b>?

00:00:33.309 --> 00:00:34.343
Why <b>did</b> you <b>go</b>?